  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-30T06:17:46.139Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The filename of the output_log in `%appdata%\\..\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\VRChat` may conflict with the name of the newly created file since the time format is `hh-mm-ss`. Also, it is assumed that the retention period of this log is the same as the one of the cache. Therefore, if a large number of logs are accumulated, the possibility of a conflict increases.\nTherefore, I propose to use `yyyy-MM-dd_hh-mm-ss.fff` for output_log's DateTime format like the one of the photo.",
